!! SEVEN Language - Math operations

a = 10
b = 3

show a + b       !! 13
show a - b       !! 7
show a * b       !! 30
show a / b       !! 3
show a % b       !! 1
show a ** 2      !! 100

!! Bit operations
x = 0b1010
y = 0b1100

show x & y       !! AND
show x | y       !! OR
show x ^ y       !! XOR
show ~x          !! NOT
show x << 2      !! Left shift
show x >> 1      !! Right shift
